{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123413","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123413/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123413/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123413/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123413","id":5424380595,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQ1F6sw","number":123413,"title":"Crash or freeze when `Max Threads` Setting = 0","user":{"login":"Schnorg","id":44937651,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTM3NjUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44937651?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg","html_url":"https://github.com/Schnorg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-09-11T12:38:09Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T16:19:55Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.7.2-stable and latest master (commit cb41ea1159)\n\n### System information\n\nMacOS M5 arm64 32Gb Tahoe 26.6.2\n\n### Issue description\n\nGames will either crash of freeze at startup if you set the Project setting \"Threading/Threading/Worker Pool/Max Threads\" to 0.\n\nAs a result, there is no way to make your game operate on just one main thread via settings. To do that, you would need to be able to set this to 0.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n* Set the \"Threading/Threading/Worker Pool/Max Threads\" Project Setting to 0.\n* Run a game or demo (for example Godot-demo-projects/2d/physics_platformer)\n* The game will usually crash of freeze at startup.\n\nIt can sometimes work (depending on the project). If it is working, try changing your other thread settings like \"Physics/2D/Run on Separate Thread\" and/or \"Rendering/Driver/Thread Model\".\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nJust about any project seems to reproduce the crash for me. Godot-demo-projects/2d/physics_platformer should crash.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123413/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123413/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}